 "note": "Kitty: the owner's own chonky black long-haired Maine Coon: black coat with a rusty sheen in the sun and a smoky undercoat, a big lion's mane, lynx-tipped ears, fluffy britches, a huge plume tail, white whiskers, a snaggle fang, greenish-yellow eyes that glow in the dark, a crimson collar with an emerald rune tag. Egg-only, never spawns naturally.",
 "ability_desc": "Bed buddy: when you go to sleep within 24 blocks of him he hops onto your bed and sleeps belly-up hugging your pillow; you wake up well rested with Regeneration and Absorption (Regeneration II and longer at higher bond), and he greets the morning with a big stretch. A chonky black long-haired Maine Coon with greenish-yellow eyes that shine in the dark and 86 clips, 28 of them his own: walks right up to your face and boops the camera when you look at him, licks his paw and washes his face, flashes his snaggle fang over his shoulder, lounges like a lion on stairs and slabs (his couch armrest), sprawls in sunbeams, looks up at you with huge eyes, sleeps belly-up hugging things, watches the screen, shakes out his mane, trills and chirps, wraps his plume tail round his paws, flops like a fluffy rug, yawns, tilts his head, pats the air for attention and loafs into a giant floof. Petting gets a face smush, a chin-up or a paw hug; pet him too much and he grabs your arm and bunny-kicks it. Creepers make him puff up into a Halloween cat. His mane bounces and his belly jiggles when he moves. Not found in the wild: spawn him with his egg; he arrives already named Kitty and is tamed with raw cod.",
